WEBVTT

00:00:00.371 --> 00:00:05.479
The Employee Portal home page — Where every working day starts: your apps, your numbers and your shortcuts.

00:00:06.563 --> 00:00:13.175
After signing in you land here. The greeting and today's date — and below, a tile for each app your account includes.

00:00:13.935 --> 00:00:19.791
WorkDesk: time, expenses, budgets and approvals. The tile shows your hours this week and what waits for your approval.

00:00:20.459 --> 00:00:25.562
Taskana: your tasks and boards — with your role there, your open tasks and anything overdue.

00:00:26.283 --> 00:00:31.671
The Handbook explains every screen, role by role. The Knowledge Base has onboarding, company rules and training.

00:00:32.333 --> 00:00:36.844
An app your account doesn't include shows a lock. Your administrator can change that.

00:00:37.576 --> 00:00:41.428
Colleagues with a birthday this week are reminded up here 🎂

00:00:42.039 --> 00:00:47.646
The shortcuts go straight to the everyday things: report time, ask for days off, expenses, approvals, your tasks.

00:00:48.322 --> 00:00:53.678
Install on your phone shows how to add the portal to your home screen, like an app.

00:00:54.487 --> 00:00:58.850
At the top: the language — English or Hebrew for the whole portal…

00:01:04.873 --> 00:01:06.905
…the light or dark theme…

00:01:12.036 --> 00:01:15.646
…and your profile. Sign out is next to the greeting.

00:01:16.375 --> 00:01:18.881
Click a tile to open its app. Let's open WorkDesk.

00:01:22.253 --> 00:01:25.760
The house at the top left always brings you back home.

00:01:26.495 --> 00:01:30.609
Every app, one place — More help: the Handbook → The Employee Portal.
